e agreed to. Senator Bernardi? Cory Bernardi Could I just make the point that in Australia it was 21 July when man landed on the moon. Sue Lines Senator Bernardi, if you're not moving a point of order— Cory Bernardi If you're voting for this, you're voting for falsehoods. Sue Lines The question is that parts (a) and (b) of that motion be agreed to. Question agreed to. The question is that part (c) of general business notice of motion No. 129 be agreed to.","result":"negative","slug":"division-federal-senate-10377","source_url":"https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/divisions/senate/2019-09-16/3"}
